{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントに、ブログ一年目の\n11月14日にいろいろ変えるほうが\nキリが良いのでは？\nという意見があったので..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月14日にリニューアルするね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はレッスン前に\n伊藤2でショッピングしたんだぜ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねは久しぶりの\nショッピングだったみたいで\n目がきらきらしてた笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はかわいい色のリップバーム\n買って気分るんるんしてた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、店員さんになぜか\n「髪きれいですね」ってほめられて\n嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか...今日暑かったですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく買った秋服がまだ着れない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滝汗いらりんになる前よ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクしてるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね、似てない？\n最近伊藤ちゃんず似てきてない⁇⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンでみんなに\n「えーまりかがメイクしてるー」\nてめずしがられた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「大人でしょ？」\nってドヤッたらぽいされたよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんが顔触ってくるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんが離してくれないときは\nまいやんとかずみに助けを求める。\n生駒もおさえにきて\n「まりか、今の内に逃げろ！」\n...イケメン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんとじゃれるの楽しいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口では言わないけどねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうだ！\n今日はみさにマッサージした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほめてほめて♪←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wひなと今度一緒にどっか行くこと\n約束してるんだぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみともお買い物したいね！\n趣味合うの。\n着てる服ゆるくてすき♪\nブログ読んだー！\nななみーどっか連れてってー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はメンバーの話ばっかりだ！\nたまにはこういうのも良いね。\nさて、何人の名前が\n出てきたでしょうか！♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木充"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/4999427/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日も頑張りまりか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}